OL,3,GNEWSA'Why were 50 cameras pointing at
OL,4,Amy window?'
OL,5,
OL,6,FLooking out of your window to find "at
OL,7,Fleast 50" photographers staring back at
OL,8,Fyou isn't the norm for many people.
OL,10,FBut that's what teenager Max was faced
OL,11,Fwith when a rare bird settled on the
OL,12,Fguttering of the Norfolk house he was
OL,13,Fstaying in.
OL,15,FMax had come face to face with a flock
OL,16,Fof bird fans who had travelled from far
OL,17,Fand wide to Mundesley in the hope of
OL,18,Fspotting a northern nutcracker, not
OL,19,Fseen in the UK since 1991.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
