OL,3,GNEWSA'Why were 50 cameras pointing at
OL,4,Amy window?'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 17-year-old said: "It was mad
OL,7,Fbecause all the photographers that were
OL,8,Faround in the street, it looked like
OL,9,Fthey were all taking photos of us."
